    body: "Pro-Palestine activists from the ‘People Against Genocide’ group occupied a Martin-Baker factory in the UK, accusing the company of supplying ejection-seat components for aircraft used by Israel’s military. The group says the action aims to disrupt Britain’s military support for Israel.",
