    url: "https://www.ansa.it/sito/videogallery/mondo/2026/08/24/von-der-leyen-dallue-61-miliardi-a-kiev-per-la-difesa-aerea-missili_8009b824-2a27-4d2e-8555-d5c23802081c.html",
